      "review_description": "I had a great experience working with Dream Solar. Wonderful sales support, excellent installers. I couldn't fault anything with their quotation and quality control in terms of installation.All standards adhered to. Dream Solar quoted a better, more affordable solution than a competitor I was on the point of signing up with.Now I have an 11kW 3 phase system with 315W KuPower Canadian Solar panels producing power from low-light dawn till dusk. The installation team left no mess behind and were polite and courteous.Happy to give Dream Solar a 5 from 5 and thoroughly recommend them to residential and commercial customers in the greater Brisbane area.",
